<title>USA: TABLE- Network Q1 June net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Network Q1 June net drops.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>3</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	  loss $0.23	    profit$0.03</p>
<p> Net	  loss 2,639	    profit225</p>
<p> Revs		24,988		   21.1</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  11,487		   N/A</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Network Long Distance Inc took a $2.2 million charge to merge with Eastern Telecom International Corp in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Excluding the merger charge and including Eastern's operations, Network's pro forma net income was $154,000, or $0.01 a share, in the second quarter of 1997, compared with a pro-forma net income of $397,000, or $0.04 a share, in the 1996 quarter.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
